# Publish `src/user` as the versioned SHAR release ZIP

Publish exactly the intended `src/user/` release surface as
`shar-v<version>.zip`, with no repository caches, proprietary source, original
game assets, Unreal source tree, or developer-only build state.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Produce the ZIP exclusively from the declared `src/user/` release tree.
- [ ] Include integrity hashes for the ZIP and generated/reconstructed binaries
  as user-verifiable tamper/modification evidence; hashes are never algorithm
  input and a matching hash is not a general antivirus verdict.
- [ ] Verify every selected supported target can be produced from a clean ZIP
  plus lawful local source and required external platform toolchains.
- [ ] Verify desktop folders can be copied elsewhere and launched independently;
  verify APK/IPA outputs use the documented platform flow.
- [ ] Keep handwritten player/modder changelogs nontechnical and separate from
  build evidence.
- [ ] Update README from TODO-labelled future tense to exact release behavior as
  each promised surface becomes real.

## Dependencies

Depends on the complete `src/user` exporter/GUI and final platform verification.

## Evidence

P5 owns the public ZIP publication proof; it does not own base-game conversion.
